## ⬜ YOUR BRIDGES GO BELOW

Empty on purpose — a fresh install has no neighbours declared.

⚠️ **Each entry you add must have a matching `gates:` entry in `mente.config.yml`.** Writing it
only here is writing a rule with nothing behind it.

---

## ⛔ IF YOU ARE THE AGENT READING THIS

You may **know** these exist. You may **point** at them. You may **not** read them until asked.

⭐ **If you think you need one: say so and stop.** Explain what you would look for and why. The
person decides. Reading first and reporting afterwards is not initiative — it is spending somebody
else's resources on a guess, and there is no way to take it back.

